# An authenticated summary-only page. Session cookies are supplied by the client.
GET /api/v1/views/list?type=card&limit=50 HTTP/1.1
Host: projects.example
Accept: application/json

### Full-text search within updates
GET /api/v1/views/list?type=update&q=review&limit=50 HTTP/1.1
Host: projects.example.test
